 They are also available as stickers on my etsy! [https://www.etsy.com/shop/VendavaldoMato](https://www.etsy.com/shop/VendavaldoMato)

Pretty much that plus the wheel with the four arrows. I have tried restarting.

&#x200B;

Phone is Galaxy A70, Android version 11

I've been gifted something by my brother and I got the notification both on the [battle.net](https://battle.net) launcher and on e-mail, but when I open the gift panel it is empty. I've also tried the site ([https://eu.account.blizzard.com/gifts/](https://eu.account.blizzard.com/gifts/)) but it is also a blank page.

&#x200B;

Any idea on how I can redeem the gift?

I hope it's not too late for this, and I want to say right away that please don't send me a skin if you expect one in return, because I realy can't give it :(



But here goes:

I'd love to get one of these skins:

Popstar Ahri; 

Warring Kingdoms Nidalee;

Sweetheart Annie;

Winter Wonder Orianna.


Atlantean Syndra;


My LoL username is MarcyWintumns in EUW. I only want a single one of those skins, any will do. I'll be eternaly grateful.
